'''You Will Find Happiness''' (今度こそ君を幸せに, ''Kondo koso Kimi o Shiawase ni'', '''Make You Happy This Time''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]].

==Effect==
"EVA Angel Killer" Effect UP (XL): Increases the effect of the [[EVA Angel Killer]] ability. [[:Category:EVA Angel Killer Cats|EVA Angel Killers]] now inflict 25x damage and only receive 1/25 as much damage from [[:Category:EVA Angel Enemies|EVA Angels]].

